ichikusatravel.shinkansenwindow" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-lp-cta="entry-https-play-google-com-store-apps-details-id-com-michikusatravel-shinkansenwindow"><img src="images/android/app-icon-192.webp" width="24" height="24" alt=""><span class="app-link-copy"><strong>画面を消しても音声案内</strong><small>Androidアプリ · Google Play ↗</small></span></a></article></div></div></section><section class="enjoy-window"><div class="section-shell"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">PLAY &amp; COLLECT</p><h2>車窓をもっと楽しむ</h2><p><span class="copy-chunk">見つけて、集めて、答えて。</span><span class="copy-chunk">景色との出会いを、旅の楽しみに。</span></p></div><div class="enjoy-grid"><a class="enjoy-link" href="journal.html" data-lp-cta="enjoy-journal"><span class="enjoy-art enjoy-collection" aria-hidden="true"><img class="enjoy-medal" src="images/medals/emblem-fuji.webp" alt=""><img class="enjoy-stamp" src="images/stamps/stamp_kakegawa.svg" alt=""></span><span class="enjoy-copy"><h3>スタンプとメダル<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></h3><p>見つけた景色をスタンプに。集めながら、シリーズごとのメダルを育てよう。</p></span></a><a class="enjoy-link" href="window-quiz.html" data-lp-cta="enjoy-quiz"><span class="enjoy-art enjoy-quiz"><img src="images/20260704_maruko_bridge_1_michikusa.jpg" alt="川を渡るアーチ形の橋"><span aria-hidden="true">この車窓、どこ？</span></span><span class="enjoy-copy"><h3>車窓クイズ<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></h3><p>写真で名前当て、動画で場所当て。見慣れた車窓にも、新しい発見が。</p></span></a></div></div></section>